      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Super-Easy-Low-Carb-Cookie-Dough-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, combine the allulose, almond flour, and protein powder.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/super-easy-low-carb-cookie-dough/#wprm-recipe-54929-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Super-Easy-Low-Carb-Cookie-Dough-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the whipped cottage cheese into the dry ingredients and mix together well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/super-easy-low-carb-cookie-dough/#wprm-recipe-54929-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Super-Easy-Low-Carb-Cookie-Dough-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once combined, fold in the chocolate chips until well distributed.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/super-easy-low-carb-cookie-dough/#wprm-recipe-54929-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Super-Easy-Low-Carb-Cookie-Dough-7.jpg"
